    <briefdescription>
<para>Registry of theme directory files — 2 section keys. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Nested inside <ref refid="structconfig_1_1_file" kindref="compound">File</ref>. CRTP-derived from <ref refid="classjam_1_1Map_1_1Instance" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::Map::Instance&lt;Theme&gt;</ref>.</para>
<para>Maps each enum key to its Identifier stem and resolves the on-disk filename via <ref refid="structconfig_1_1_file_1_1_theme_1aae7b0309384b8333ee5d8daa47406edb" kindref="member">getName()</ref>. All keys produce &quot;stem.lua&quot;.</para>
<para>Owns the themes root directory path. The live instance is owned by <ref refid="classend_1_1_application" kindref="compound">end::Application</ref> — static <ref refid="structconfig_1_1_file_1_1_theme_1a259522514f9d57dccbffc3e3f1349a7f" kindref="member">get()</ref> resolves through Context&lt;Theme&gt;. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
